        "original_id": "ac208bc0-07fc-5dbd-a0bd-e7ccd6361ce3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: U2\n- Events: U2 360° Tour, 2 July 2009 Barcelona concert\n- Concepts: live performance, in-the-round staging\n\nFacts:\n- U2 did not perform \"Electrical Storm\" live until 2 July 2009, when they played it at the second Barcelona concert of the U2 360° Tour.\n- The U2 360° Tour was a worldwide concert tour by the rock band U2.\n- The U2 360° Tour concerts used an in-the-round format on a circular stage that allowed the audience to surround the band on all sides.",
